# Context exclusions for enchantee_racing/Dockerfile.
#
# Named Dockerfile.dockerignore rather than .dockerignore, and that is not a typo.
# Docker reads .dockerignore from the *context root*, which for these images is
# python/, not this directory. A .dockerignore sitting here would be silently ignored
# on every build that build.sh drives, which is what has happened to
# event_recorder/.dockerignore. BuildKit does honour <dockerfile-path>.dockerignore,
# so this file works, and it applies to this image alone rather than to every image
# built out of python/.
#
# Paths are relative to the context root, so they carry the enchantee_racing/ prefix.
#
# This is about build speed only. Safety comes from the Dockerfile's COPY allow-list,
# which names each thing the app serves and therefore cannot leak a file added to
# docs/ later.

# The club's paperwork: the fixtures PDF and the Geng course marks chart. The chart is
# copyright Geng Pty Ltd and carries a notice against redistribution (DESIGN 6), and
# this image is pushed to a public registry.
enchantee_racing/docs/

# Tests and the recorded GPS tracks they replay, 3.7 MB. The app does not run them.
enchantee_racing/tests/

# Dev-time generators. Two only run on Windows and all their outputs are committed.
enchantee_racing/scripts/

enchantee_racing/__pycache__/
enchantee_racing/**/__pycache__/
enchantee_racing/**/*.py[cod]
